      "created_at": "2015-08-28T03:29:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, I've started to set up a new neighborhood of the sims, where all of the heros and villains are in the same neighborhood. I want to start with the base set, and I want to have the freedom five living together in a mansion, with baron across the street. I need help thinking of all the relations. Who's neighbors with who, where does everybody live with, and what is the qualities of the houses, what jobs would they do, what are their personalities, and how much do they like/hate other people? I'll edit in what I plan on doing for everybody as it goes along</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Freedom Five: The Freedom Five are going to live on a cul-de-sac, with the Wraith being at the very end of it in a Mansion, Legacy will live with his daughter in a Middle Class house with a gym, across from Tachyon and Abs Zero (who will have a basic living room and most of the stuff in the basement). Bunker will be next to legacy and have a fairly simple house with a huge training center in the basement (Thank you for the reccomendations, Arcanist Lupus)</p><p>They ended up being on a loop, not a culdesac, so in the middle of the loop, there is a park with a community center in it (My take on their \"Freedom Tower\")</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Personalities (I'll fill these in as I complete the sims):</p><p>The Parsons (Legacys): Charismatic and athletic families, who are kind people. Their goals involve being the top politicians (the life goal name was something like \"Leader of the Free\"), With their favorite foods being Hamburgers and Hot Dogs (\"American\" food)</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:20.427Z",
